    "In ChatGPT on the web, connect a custom MCP server at this HTTPS address with OAuth. When ChatGPT opens the GSD sign-in page, enter this code. The code expires after 10 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In ChatGPT on the web, connect a custom MCP server at this HTTPS address with OAuth. When ChatGPT opens the GSD sign-in page, enter this code. The code expires after 10 minutes."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "באתר ChatGPT יש לחבר שרת MCP מותאם אישית לכתובת HTTPS זו באמצעות OAuth. כשייפתח דף הכניסה של GSD, יש להזין בו את הקוד. הקוד תקף לעשר דקות."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "In Settings, About has a What's New screen with the notes for every recent version, newest first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Settings, About has a What's New screen with the notes for every recent version, newest first."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ב„אודות” שבהגדרות מופיע מסך „מה חדש” עם הערות לכל הגרסאות האחרונות, מהחדשה לישנה."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "In another app, share a link or some text and choose Add to GSD to capture it. Search for a task in Spotlight to open it in GSD.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In another app, share a link or some text and choose Add to GSD to capture it. Search for a task in Spotlight to open it in GSD."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "מתוך יישום אחר משתפים קישור או טקסט ובוחרים „הוספה ל־GSD”. חיפוש משימה ב־Spotlight פותח אותה ב־GSD."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "In columns, a narrow task card drops its ⋯ button so the title has more room. Long press the card for the same menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In columns, a narrow task card drops its ⋯ button so the title has more room. Long press the card for the same menu."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "בכרטיס צר בתצוגת עמודות יש יותר מקום לכותרת. לחיצה ממושכת פותחת את תפריט ⋯."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "In the task editor, turn on Has due date, then pick Today, This week (Friday), or Next week (Monday), or choose a date. A due date is all day until you turn off All day and set a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the task editor, turn on Has due date, then pick Today, This week (Friday), or Next week (Monday), or choose a date. A due date is all day until you turn off All day and set a time."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "בעורך המשימה מפעילים „יש תאריך יעד” ובוחרים היום, השבוע (יום שישי), בשבוע הבא (יום שני), או תאריך אחר. כדי לקבוע שעה מכבים את „כל היום”."
          }
        }
