          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The task editor asks before discarding changes, and only when you made some."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "העורך מבקש אישור לפני ויתור על שינויים, ורק אם בוצע שינוי."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The watch gets your tasks straight from your iPhone, so it works with no account. When your iPhone is out of reach, the watch holds your changes until it can deliver them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The watch gets your tasks straight from your iPhone, so it works with no account. When your iPhone is out of reach, the watch holds your changes until it can deliver them."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "המשימות מגיעות לשעון ישירות מה־iPhone גם ללא חשבון. כשהטלפון מחוץ לטווח, השעון שומר את השינויים עד שיוכל להעביר אותם."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The weekly sweep walks you through tasks that need a decision, one at a time. Each card says why it's there, such as Due date passed or No date yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The weekly sweep walks you through tasks that need a decision, one at a time. Each card says why it's there, such as Due date passed or No date yet."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "הסקירה השבועית מציגה בזו אחר זו משימות שדורשות החלטה. בכל כרטיס מופיעה הסיבה, למשל „מועד היעד חלף” או „עדיין אין תאריך”."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The ⋯ button, or a long press, has the rest: Edit, Duplicate, Move to Saved, Share, Complete, the timer, Snooze, Move to, and Delete. On Mac, right-click a card for the same menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ⋯ button, or a long press, has the rest: Edit, Duplicate, Move to Saved, Share, Complete, the timer, Snooze, Move to, and Delete. On Mac, right-click a card for the same menu."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "נגיעה ב־⋯ או לחיצה ממושכת מציגה עריכה, שכפול, העברה לשמורים, שיתוף, השלמה, שעון עצר, דחייה, העברה ומחיקה. ב־Mac אפשר גם ללחוץ בכפתור העכבר הימני."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The ⋯ menu": {
