    "When a sweep is due, a Weekly sweep line shows above the matrix. You can start one from Settings anytime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a sweep is due, a Weekly sweep line shows above the matrix. You can start one from Settings anytime."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "כשמגיע הזמן לסקירה, מופיעה שורת „סקירה שבועית” מעל המטריצה. אפשר גם להתחיל סקירה מההגדרות בכל עת."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "When a task that isn't marked urgent is due within two days (the default), or is overdue, its card says Escalating. Mark urgent moves it to Do First, or to Delegate if it isn't important. Find Mark urgent in the ⋯ menu, or swipe left on iPhone and iPad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a task that isn't marked urgent is due within two days (the default), or is overdue, its card says Escalating. Mark urgent moves it to Do First, or to Delegate if it isn't important. Find Mark urgent in the ⋯ menu, or swipe toward the start of the row on iPhone and iPad."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "משימה שאינה דחופה תסומן „הדחיפות עולה” כשנותרו יומיים עד למועד היעד (כברירת מחדל) או כשהיא באיחור. סימון כדחופה מעביר אותה לרבע „לביצוע מיידי”, או לרבע „להעביר לאחרים” אם אינה חשובה. הפעולה זמינה בתפריט ⋯ או בהחלקה ב־iPhone וב־iPad."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "When another device moves a task's due date, this device reminds you at the new time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When another device moves a task's due date, this device reminds you at the new time."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "שינוי מועד היעד ממכשיר אחר מעדכן את שעת התזכורת גם במכשיר הזה."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "When can ChatGPT use tools?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
